title: Work a Delegation
subtitle: One district's delegates have not made up their minds.
view-if: congress = 1 and congress_closing = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
RG.congress.target();
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Delegation from [+ congress_target_name +]

The [+ congress_target_name +] delegation sits together near the back of the hall: [+ congress_target_opposed +] delegates who mostly follow the [+ congress_target_faction_name +] and have not yet said how they will vote. Their district secretary is smoking in the corridor, and waiting to be asked.

A delegate votes the way his district told him to, unless someone gives him a better reason before the vote.

- @speakers: Send our best speakers to their caucus.
- @promise: Promise the district a voice in the new Zentrale.
- @secretary: Lean on the district secretary.
- @leave: Leave them to make up their own minds.

@speakers
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Wins over part of the delegation, honestly.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds for the hall and the beer.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.congress_last_moved = RG.congress.convert(Q.congress_target, 0.28 + Math.random() * 0.1);
RG.congress.tally();
Q['lean_' + Q.congress_backing] += 1;
!}

Our speakers argue with the [+ congress_target_name +] delegates until two in the morning. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] of them come over to us. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : Nobody changes sides, but nobody walks out either. ?]

@promise
subtitle: Wins over many of them. The rest of the party will notice the price.
on-arrival: {!
Q.congress_last_moved = RG.congress.convert(Q.congress_target, 0.4);
RG.congress.tally();
RG.district(Q.congress_target, {loyalty: 5});
RG.congress.bitter(1);
Q.unity -= 2;
Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 3;
!}

The district will have one of its own in the Zentrale, and a say in who edits its paper. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates come over to us. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : The delegates thank us, and say they will think about it. ?] Other districts start asking what they will get.

@secretary
subtitle: The district apparatus can deliver its delegates. Bad blood follows.
choose-if: congress_target_loyal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The district's apparatus does not answer to the Zentrale.
on-arrival: {!
Q.congress_last_moved = RG.congress.convert(Q.congress_target, 0.35);
RG.congress.tally();
RG.district(Q.congress_target, {loyalty: -6});
RG.congress.bitter(2);
!}

The secretary has a word with the delegates whose wages the district pays. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] of them discover that they agree with us after all. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : They are all volunteers, it turns out. ?] The others will remember how it was done.

@leave
subtitle: Costs nothing. Most of them will vote as they came.
on-arrival: {!
Q.congress_last_moved = (Math.random() < 0.5) ? RG.congress.convert(Q.congress_target, 0.1) : 0;
RG.congress.tally();
Q.unity += 1;
!}

We leave the [+ congress_target_name +] delegation alone. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : Some of them notice, and like it: [+ congress_last_moved +] come over to us on their own. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : They vote as they came. ?]
